    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334200/extras/4d4b7f6b40b1834ef5c5881809ec1004.avif?t=1739401381\" data-has-big width=800 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Day One is a visual novel where you will meet Sergey and explore his life. The game's world is filled with mysteries, romance, and tough choices that you will make to help Sergey overcome challenges and build a successful life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a rich story that will vary greatly for each player. On a second playthrough, you are sure to discover even more details that reveal deeper insights into the characters and their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334200/extras/055610fbd2bb2686c727fd0c8e8189ae.avif?t=1739401381\" data-has-big width=800 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATE YOUR UNIQUE STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sergey is a typical programmer facing the challenges of everyday life in a big city. With your decisions, he can either overcome his struggles or\u2026 well, let's not dwell on that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334200/extras/f652a41ca6eda961574b78b28708da1b.avif?t=1739401381\" data-has-big width=800 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A WORLD OF VIVID CHARACTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey in One Day One, you, as Sergey, will encounter a wide variety of characters who will have very different attitudes toward you. Nevertheless, you\u2019ll need to build relationships with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course, with many of them, you can spark a romance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334200/extras/b7ed415b11aa7548805898a7ba044165.avif?t=1739401381\" data-has-big width=800 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HIDDEN DEPTHS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of One Day One is filled with multifaceted characters who will make different decisions depending on the situation. However, their loyalty to you depends solely on your earlier actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, be careful when interacting with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
