, will encounter a wide variety of characters who will have very different attitudes toward you. Nevertheless, you\u2019ll need to build relationships with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course, with many of them, you can spark a romance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334200/extras/b7ed415b11aa7548805898a7ba044165.avif?t=1739401381\" data-has-big width=800 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HIDDEN DEPTHS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of One Day One is filled with multifaceted characters who will make different decisions depending on the situation. However, their loyalty to you depends solely on your earlier actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, be careful when interacting with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
